WEBVTT

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.820
We interrupt your regularly
scheduled programming!

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:40.980
We're going to broadcast a special match
from BEGA for Beyblade's pro league!

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:47.100
Against the leader of Neo-Borg and
runner up in the world championships!

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.080
Yuriy Ivanov!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.760
You can't miss this chance to see
a pro Blader's skills in action!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:00.300
Anyone who lives near BEGA HQ
should head to the arena right away!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.600
Oh, my...

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.980
Is it true that Yuriy and
BEGA are gonna battle?

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.980
Let us in!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.900
Calmly, please!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.320
No running!

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:32.700
Yuriy Ivanov. I've prepared
this stadium just for you.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:37.170
You can go all out.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.650
Your confidence will
be your downfall.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:43.480
I'm going to embarrass
you for all to see!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.800
I beg to differ.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:50.400
But this is a good chance to show what the pros are really made of.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.080
Allow me to
return the favor.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:02.660
In this gorgeous stadium!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.850
Who cares.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.960
Get ready!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.340
Rushing won't change
the result of our battle.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.540
Just wait a little longer.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.720
I made it first!

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.370
I'm over here!

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:18.040
What?

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:24.210
So many people, and so fast!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:29.100
It just goes to show that pro
Beyblading is a hot topic.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.850
This is an important
match for us.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:41.050
What's Yuriy up to?
And what's Volkov's ideal pro like?

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.480
I guess we're
about to find out.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:46.340
Yeah!
Beyblades don't lie!

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:50.360
We'll be watching
your battle, Yuriy.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:54.200
And then I'll choose the
path I believe in.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.860
Time for an emergency
special match!

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:02.060
Who will win?
BEGA's own Garland?

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:05.650
Or the world championship
runner-up, Yuriy?

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.980
I see you came prepared.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:13.020
A showman has nothing
to hide, after all.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:17.080
But this perfect for me.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:20.650
You won't be able to
call yourselves pros

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:24.970
if I shut you down
right here and now.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.210
The battle the whole world is watching is about to begin!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:33.080
We just barely made it.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:36.120
Takao! And Yuriy, too?

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:41.280
Three! Two! One!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.000
Go, Shoot!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:55.010
You're pretty powerful
for an endurance type.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.650
Consider that my greeting!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.780
Go, Wolborg!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:11.080
This is Yuriy's specialty!
An assault of attacks!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.360
Does he have
Garland on the edge?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.520
Yeah! Keep it up, Yuriy!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.650
No, this is...

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.060
No!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.250
It may look like Yuriy
is on the attack,

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:27.410
but each attack is just
barely missing the mark!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.410
He won't be finishing
anyone off like that!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.820
I knew you'd notice.

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:37.610
Garland likes to take each and
every one of his opponent's attacks.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:40.400
It's a bad habit.
Or more like a hobby?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.800
His hobby?

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.610
I don't really see
why, myself...

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.220
He takes the minimum amount of damage with the minimum amount of movement.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:57.010
Garland is like a boxer who dodges
attacks by the skin of his teeth.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:01.980
So Yuriy isn't even
really hitting him!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.130
He's good.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.280
Yuriy...

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:10.330
Well?
Is that still your greeting?

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.730
Blast you...

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:19.210
Why?! Why is someone as strong
as you working for Volkov?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.970
Our interests line up.

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:24.160
I simply want to go pro!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:29.890
Have you heard of the Siebald family?
We're well known in sports.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.410
Siebald family?

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:36.560
Yes. My mother and father spread
their names far across the globe.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.750
As first rate pro athletes!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:42.050
My three older brothers
and older sister.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:45.670
Each of them earning
glory in their own paths.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:53.770
What can I do to attain glory equal to theirs
that's befitting of a member of the Siebald family?

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:58.130
And that was when
I learned of Beyblade.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.560
Which is why...

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:05.490
If pro Beyblading will earn me
glory equal to that of my siblings...

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.850
Then I don't care
who runs it!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:12.930
You're a fool! You don't
know what Volkov's up to!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:19.130
Can you see that he's taking advantage of those very feelings? Of your talent?!

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:23.480
BEGA can give you all the equipment
and facilities you could ever ask for.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:27.850
I can't see why you wouldn't
use them for your own benefit.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:31.980
My own benefit? In the end,
it's all for Volkov's benefit!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.460
I will never follow his
orders ever again!

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.660
Too bad.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.700
We can't seem to come
to an agreement.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.000
So I will...

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:52.140
Have you become a
sacrifice for my path to glory!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.560
He's so fast!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:06.040
Attack, defense, speed...

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.960
He doesn't have
any openings at all!

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:10.850
Yuriy...

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:20.380
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:24.220
Your next attack will
spell your doom!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:29.780
This is the end for you!!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.180
Take this!

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:34.690
Novae Rog!!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.650
What?!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.700
There it is!
Yuriy's special move!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.200
Did he win?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.180
I see now...

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.860
He's good.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.580
But I am...

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:58.220
Still up.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.800
Then...!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.860
Again!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:11.200
Novae Rog!!

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.600
It's gone!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.130
Your attacks are meaningless
if they can't hit me!

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.300
I'm still in!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.130
No! Yuriy's attacks
aren't working!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.800
What?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.260
He's not as strong
as I thought.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.180
Reaching your limit?

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.400
Let me end
this for you!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:02.880
Wolborg's got a one way
ticket to a Stadium Out!

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.480
Is this the end?

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.740
Yuriy!

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.560
It's over...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.410
What is this?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:24.810
I acknowledge your skill in winning
with the least amount of power.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:30.330
But I think your technique
is difficult to understand.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:35.130
It would be rude to the
audience to end it here.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:38.260
Is this also to establish
BEGA's reputation?

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.780
When does it end?

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.460
No way!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:43.650
They're going to continue?

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:50.290
Announcement: This match will
continue until one Bey stops spinning.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.170
I'm enforcing a
perfect victory rule.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.000
No way!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.900
It's already clear who won...

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:03.160
Chairman Volkov says
the match is still on!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.780
It's still on!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:09.490
Is this the cruelty of
a pro league battle?!

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:12.040
Yeah, go get 'em!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.530
We wanted to see
more anyway!

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.060
Don't take it personally.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.000
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:43.800
I won't let you beat me!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.930
It's a pro's job to meet the
audience's expectations.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:51.290
Sorry, but I'll need you to stick
around for a little longer!

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:03.810
Yeah! This is what
we wanted to see!

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.700
BEGA is so cool!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.090
Go, Garland!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.160
Darn you...

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:25.720
Yuriy!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.700
That's enough!
Yuriy's at his limit!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:34.770
What's the point in
letting it continue?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.490
Crap! We have to
do something!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.530
Go for it, Yuriy!

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.660
Yuriy...

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.780
There you are,
Kai Hiwatari.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.560
I was wondering where
you were all this time.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:53.260
You're one to talk.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:57.960
Are you worried about the
predicament your friend's in?

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:03.160
Friend? I only joined his
team to fight Kinomiya.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.320
I'm not his friend.

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.380
However...

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:08.660
However?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.140
There is one thing
that bothers me.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:14.540
Did Yuriy know this
would happen?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:19.080
At the end of the day, Yuriy
was the closest person to Volkov.

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:22.930
It's not strange to think he was one of the first to hear about BEGA.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:29.460
While all of you aimed to fight Takao
Kinomiya in the world championships...

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:33.900
Yuriy was solely focused on
becoming the champion.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.180
That's right, Kai Hiwatari.

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:39.330
So much so that he even
drew you onto his team.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:42.240
As for Volkov...

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:47.400
The Beyblade world champion is his number one roadblock.

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:53.040
He can claim that
the pros are the best...

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:59.740
But without the tournament's winner on your
side, it'll be hard to convince the public.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:07.300
Yuriy knew that the world champion would
become BEGA's target right from the start.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:10.810
Yuriy...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.500
I can't lose!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.840
I will not accept defeat!

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:28.840
Yuriy...

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.330
What's pushing you this far?

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.720
We understand, Yuriy!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.380
Stay down!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:40.220
That's enough, Volkov!
Call off the battle!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.980
Is this how your pro
league does business?!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.600
What's the point in
letting this continue?!

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:52.520
The world champion
seems to have an issue...

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.300
If that's how you're going
to act, I'll let him finish.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:05.480
Consider this your
reward for lasting so long!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:07.140
Take this!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:10.850
Radiant...

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:14.080
Thunder!!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.780
Yuriy!

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:47.250
Yuriy!
Stay with me!

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:48.650
This...

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:51.250
How horrible...
That was no battle!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.410
Yuriy... Darn!

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.260
Who cares about
pros or BEGA?

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:58.140
Darn them...

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.900
They'd go so far
just to show off!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:07.920
Right! He hasn't changed
a bit from the Borg days!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:11.360
Do you see now, Kinomiya?

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.450
Yuriy...!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.250
Volkov hasn't
changed at all.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.450
You remember
Barthez Soldat, right?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:23.650
Barthez Soldat?
They were...

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:29.780
They were a test team sent into
the world championships by BEGA.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.850
And their coach...

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:35.140
Barthez, the man himself,
was a pawn of Volkov's.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.440
--What?!
--What?!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:42.020
Come to think of it, the way they used flashy
tricks to appease the crowd is just like BEGA...

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:47.970
Volkov intended to premiere them as the first of BEGA's pro Bladers

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:50.940
after their growing popularity in the world championships.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.770
As a team of
world champions.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:58.410
But after battling
you Kinomiya,

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:02.330
all of them learned the true
meaning of Beybattles.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.680
Ending their
plan in failure.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:13.210
Volkov may have abandoned his plan to use Bladers as his own soldiers...

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:22.260
But he merely changed those plans after seeing
how soldiers like Mihael and I revolted...

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:31.330
Instead of trying to challenge Beyblading
with soldiers of his own creation...

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:39.450
He's trying to take it over under
the guise of a benevolent trainer.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.290
Don't be fooled by
the idea of going pro.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:47.850
It's just a tool to wrangle
the masses and the media.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.210
He just wants...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.250
He just wants to...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.660
Control Beyblading
as if it were his own!

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.770
Yuriy!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.120
Volkov!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:05.290
How dare you, Yuriy...

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:09.050
BEGA's taken
off their gloves!

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:12.480
I can't wait to see where
the pro league goes!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.000
Get real!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:20.240
All this stuff about pros
and BEGA is a load of garbage!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:25.200
Volkov! You won't lay a finger on
the Beyblading we cherish so dearly!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:29.400
Kinomiya, what are you...?

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:33.940
Remember this!
I'm gonna crush BEGA flat!

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:38.530
What's going on here?

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:43.520
Kinomiya issues a challenge
to the new pro league!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:47.280
Takao Kinomiya doesn't
wanna go pro?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.480
What's his problem with BEGA?

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:56.170
What does Chairman Volkov have to say to Kinomiya's challenge?

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:58.600
It was inevitable...

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:04.120
It would have been nice to have
the world champion on our side...

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:09.850
We seem to have a problem. Going pro
should be the dream of all Bladers.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:16.440
Or so I thought, but I can't ignore the three-time world champ's words.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:21.850
Perhaps we should settle matters
of Beyblade with Beyblades.

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.460
Kinomiya.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:28.080
How about a competition between
you and BEGA's chosen Bladers?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.540
If we somehow lose to you,

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:34.560
I will give up on professional
Beyblading. No questions asked.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:38.940
I'll even give the position of
chairman back to Daitenji.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:45.130
We've got a sudden
confirmation of a big match!

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:53.080
It's the first battle between the pro Bladers
and the world champions who challenge them!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.080
Hell yeah! It's on!

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.810
Show 'em what you got!

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.440
Yeah, BEGA!

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:00.600
Now this is what
pros are like!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.840
But how?!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.020
It's just like with Barthez.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:09.520
They're hooked on
Volkov's every word.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.700
They don't know the truth.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.490
I'll help you out, Takao.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.320
I may not be much
help, but so will I.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.650
And me too!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.610
Guys!

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:28.020
Figures. If Takao won't help them,
this is the only other choice.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:31.840
Anyone who challenges my
ideals must be eliminated.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:38.880
I'll eliminate the current system along
with the world champion Takao Kinomiya.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:40.730
Takao...

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.720
Looks like things
are getting interesting.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.090
Will you participate as well?

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:49.960
I will, but...

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:51.780
Are you going?

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:53.850
And what of you?

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.860
Look, it's Rei!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.320
Rei!

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.660
Takao! Over there!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.160
Kai!

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.620
Kai! I knew you'd come!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:23.220
Kai...!

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:32.860
Why, Kai?
Why are you...?!

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.340
Kai!

00:22:55.640 --> 00:23:03.240
I have no intention of joining BEGA, but I have reservations about joining you.

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:08.490
So let's battle, Takao!
Show me Takao Kinomiya at 100%!

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:10.860
What? All right, Rei!

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:14.900
I don't know why, but if you want to battle that badly I accept!

00:23:14.900 --> 00:23:19.960
I'm not stingy enough to only give 100%.
I'm always at 1,000%!
